[{"title":"如意而归","author":"张鹏翮","text":"临水登山兴未休，闲身乐世更何忧？\n联裾萧寺探幽径，方驾扁舟泛碧流。\n尊俎每开长寿酒，寻芳频向浣花游。\n怡情云外皆无累，弄月吟风得自由！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16029,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元日在重庆","author":"张鹏翮","text":"晴川一望曙烟收，静坐蓬窗得自由。\n爆竹千门催腊去，明灯万盏映江流。\n和风习习占年稔，春日迟迟揽胜游。\n遥忆京华多盛事，五云佳气满龙楼！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16030,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"连枝会","author":"张鹏翮","text":"分手天涯但可怜，相逢白发转凄然。\n几年苦忆连枝会，此际欣遭不夜天。\n堂上同看银树合，尊前喜咏白云篇。\n乾坤岁岁浮春色，明月今宵却更圆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16031,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哀鸿","author":"张鹏翮","text":"一望汪洋剧可怜，更从何处问桑田？\n鸡鸣犬吠无消息，木落霜空绝野烟。\n半线东堤强挽曳，孤篷渔火傍流泉。\n嗷嗷待哺民情切，引领恩膏下九天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16032,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黑柏沟祖茔被楚民侵占蒙制军清还读罢檄语感而泣下","author":"张鹏翮","text":"故园西望恨长吞，月近顽云势易昏。\n旋马久悲无夏屋，圭田何处问荒原？\n幸归百世岗峦地，得妥当年泉壤魂。\n日暮秋风生万壑，几回衫袖掩啼痕！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16033,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"万里桥","author":"张鹏翮","text":"芙蓉城外汉津梁，费氏曾乘万里航。\n玉垒祥云开蜀道，锦江春色满华阳。\n贤豪遗迹千秋在，儒雅流芳百世香。\n试问题桥云路客，何如衣锦早还乡？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16034,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月山","author":"张鹏翮","text":"过庭犹记闻诗礼，回首白云双鬓丝。\n明发有怀恩网极，养亲不逮悔何追！\n龙章凤诰焚黄日，春露秋霜结梦思。\n万里归来风木恨，四更吐月旧山时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16035,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题鹤鸣山","author":"张鹏翮","text":"紫气连云是鹤山，洞天鸡犬隔人间。\n希真已得长生诀，揽胜空余古篆斑。\n夜月几闻龙虎啸，白云常伴凤鸾还。\n神仙不在彝伦外，打破泥丸第一关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16036,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"黉宫古柏","author":"张鹏翮","text":"古柏宫墙俯碧阴，参天虬干气萧森。\n千年不老冰霜操，五夜能成风雨吟。\n魁阁阶前新岁月，九宗亭畔旧园林。\n由来神物称难得，造化全凭雨露深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16037,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"遂宁城","author":"张鹏翮","text":"十年重到德阳城，人事田畴几变更。\n仙井晴霞朝气散，鹤鸣夜月野烟轻。\n郊原几度余烽火，父老频经厌甲兵。\n所愿残邦沾化雨，桑麻从此乐深耕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16038,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题灵泉寺","author":"张鹏翮","text":"千载灵泉古道场，唐朝名胜冠诸方。\n云笼野树藏山寺，风送霜钟到德阳。\n石佛阶前秋月冷，残碑亭下稻花香。\n梯霞直上高峰顶，万里晴空望帝乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16039,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书台应瑞","author":"张鹏翮","text":"擎天柱石拂清霄，余韵流风未觉遥。\n敢谓科名高井络，愿将忠荩答清朝。\n蓬莱云近朝霞满，阆苑春深宿雾消。\n指日山灵重应瑞，三台光映大江潮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16040,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山晓钟","author":"张鹏翮","text":"响彻云霄不厌听，扶摇九万起南溟。\n每因紫气窥龙剑，却向金门识岁星。\n画戟威名光典策，朱轮勋业炳丹青。\n归来更有山林乐，五柳三槐绿满庭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16041,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"仙井晴霞","author":"张鹏翮","text":"精灵长傍落星池，散作霞光映日时。\n节与英名垂国史，魂应绝地享崇祠。\n松风夜静闻金马，仙井年深见古碑。\n若使当年身怕死，世间何处有男儿？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16042,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"涪江晚渡","author":"张鹏翮","text":"春风澹荡古东川，楝子花开绿满田。\n百福暝钟空象外，九莲明月印溪前。\n天清鹤语山头树，日暮人喧渡口船。\n铁马嘶风烟水阔，衡门归去似神仙！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16043,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹤鸣夜月","author":"张鹏翮","text":"闲上高峰望德阳，旗山涪水尽苍苍。\n丹炉人远苔生径，野寺僧稀叶满廊。\n云散渔村留月影，星回东壁映台光。\n鹤鸣石洞何须问，独自吹箫下凤凰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16044,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梵云春晓","author":"张鹏翮","text":"浪暖桃花照紫袍，春风两两送轻舠。\n酒醒画栋珠帘卷，月满清溪夜笛高。\n树尚栖鸾思往事，文余吐凤忆鸣皋。\n雨香云淡无寻处，林下琴书雅自操。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16045,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"云灵仙迹","author":"张鹏翮","text":"定水闲心能爱静，由来无欲是仙家。\n深山日丽催啼鸟，古洞风回聚落花。\n岭上白云随鹤驾，人间弦管送年华。\n题诗真宰归何处？\n绕石清泉映晚霞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16046,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旗山钟秀","author":"张鹏翮","text":"万古乾坤正气留，钟贤毓秀许谁俦？\n群山积翠当窗见，二水中分绕径流。\n遂有祯祥开蕊榜，始知紫绶满皇州。\n复忆大罗天上事，霓裳同咏凤池头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16047,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"灵泉圣境","author":"张鹏翮","text":"川中名胜古今传，清静无声一洞天。\n杳霭烟霞空法相，凄迷风雨息尘缘。\n莺巢绿树喧流水，风动飞花落讲筵。\n多少词人题不尽，高峰更有醒心泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16048,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"辋川桂花","author":"张鹏翮","text":"旧移月里树，郁郁傍层城。\n池上秋风发，清香满座生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16049,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥除夕梦中得句","author":"张鹏翮","text":"报国心思切，年衰不自由。\n欲知万里路，天际一归舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16050,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清明雨","author":"张鹏翮","text":"清明雨应时，大地报春知。\n陌头杨柳绿，却待晓风吹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16051,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水仙花","author":"张鹏翮","text":"一片芳心异，含香向早春。\n与梅能傲雪，先伴岁华新。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16052,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巫山","author":"张鹏翮","text":"地有天然美，巫山十二峰。\n谁能游览遍？\n月引度深松。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16053,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岳武穆祠","author":"张鹏翮","text":"精忠报国一身亡，为振纲常有烈光。\n青史百年公论在，牟山羡水并流芳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16054,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"范县看卫河","author":"张鹏翮","text":"魏流至此入清河，随地更名漾碧波。\n子路堤傍黄水落，孤帆一片听渔歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16055,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"太行堤","author":"张鹏翮","text":"蜿蜒千里接东西，保障洪流金作堤。\n风雨岁深波浪激，茭青芦白共凄迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16056,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凉夜中元望雨","author":"张鹏翮","text":"澹澹秋容媚晓山，垂垂珠露满田间。\n最宜虚室清凉夜，知是云龙带雨还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16057,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋后百日红花盛开","author":"张鹏翮","text":"伏尽炎蒸尚未消，思离畏景上兰桡。\n红花独自娇秋色，翻笑西风拂柳条。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16058,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"使节驻江宁闻长孙女没于含山","author":"张鹏翮","text":"坠叶凄风助旅愁，白头衔命到升州。\n含山咫尺伤心泪，一片云遮落木秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16059,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南旺寄富主事","author":"张鹏翮","text":"指日扬帆过碧滩，南湖分水更回看。\n却怜昨夜深秋雨，添得人间几度寒？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16060,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁真定祠","author":"张鹏翮","text":"门外三槐荫夕阴，祠堂深锁夜沉沉。\n典型先正今何在？\n劲竹高梧月满林。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16061,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏日经通州驿","author":"张鹏翮","text":"皇华驿里逢初夏，仆仆风尘度一春。\n回首可怜经过处，花开花落几番新！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16062,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五龙口","author":"张鹏翮","text":"山头凝雪山腰雨，日霁蒲帆挂顺风。\n不用棹歌催急鼓，轻舟早已过巴东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16063,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新滩","author":"张鹏翮","text":"登舟一望日平西，倒削芙蓉两岸齐。\n乱石横江飞白浪，涛声日夜冷凄凄。","collecti